 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use this information: Suppose that the State of Delaware received 2,000 packs of COVID-19 vaccines, with ten doses per pack. These (unopened) packs must be distributed to the three counties based on total population. Use the population information in the table below to determine how many packs of vaccine will be distributed to each county based on the given apportionment method.\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>\n</th><th>(N) New Castle</th>\n<th>(K) Kent</th>\n<th>(S) Sussex</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Residents</td>\n<td>558,753</td>\n<td>180,786</td>\n<td>234,225</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
